{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113048","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113048/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113048/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113048/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113048","id":3654588055,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc60-szh","number":113048,"title":"Fix crash in `SceneTreeDock` by pre-creating nodes for replacement","user":{"login":"wheatear-dev","id":161692702,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaM8Hg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161692702?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/wheatear-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-11-22T11:37:52Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:36:12Z","closed_at":"2025-12-05T20:14:14Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113048","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113048","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113048.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113048.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nFixes #113018.\r\n\r\nDuring a (root) `Node` replacement event such as changing its type in the UI, the old and new nodes are created and then immediately provided to `SceneTreeDock::replace_node`, at which point they may not have initialized fully.\r\n\r\nThis PR separates this single action into two steps:\r\n\r\n1. Eagerly build _all_ old and new nodes from `selection`, into a `Vector<Node *>` for each\r\n2. Iterate through `old_nodes` and `new_nodes`, calling `SceneTreeDock::replace_node` on each pair\r\n## Before\r\n\r\nChanging the node type, and saving the scene each time, would crash the editor after not many iterations.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/475bc6a3-6a4b-4097-9a25-006e7db827db\r\n\r\nSorry for the low resolution (480p), GitHub is limiting video uploads to 10MB today.\r\n\r\n\r\n## After\r\n\r\nI manually changed node type at least 20 times, saving the scene each time. No crash at all.\r\n\r\nVideo evidence of 100 successful re-types is [here, on YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nMqvV5Sdc8w). Way too long for 10MB.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nOkay attached is my MacOS-only, ChatGPT-created, terrible test-harness!\r\n\r\nIt fails with normally single digit iterations for `master`.\r\n[Test113048.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23691541/Test113048.zip), \r\n[with minimal reproduction project ](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23691611/issue-113018-2.zip)\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"wheatear-dev","id":161692702,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaM8Hg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161692702?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/wheatear-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wheatear-dev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113048/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113048/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}